                                                "example_id": "05200525-af25-4402-88f5-0b4781dc3708",
                                                "sense_id": "37283759-69f7-3e4d-8b23-7ee352e23cc5",
                                                "text": "Philip J. Klass belonged to the small and somewhat peculiar class of individuals known as debunkers."
